config PROFILE_I386
    prompt "Target profile"
    type choice
    var ROSCONFIG_PROFILE
    value generic "Generic i386"
    value pc98    "NEC PC-9800 series"
    value xbox    "Original Xbox"
    value server  "LiberNT Server (headless)"
    default generic
    depends ARCH=i386
    help
      Generic builds the standard PC target.

      NEC PC-9800 series and Original Xbox select their own HAL, boot loader
      and display drivers (the SARCH sub-architecture).

      LiberNT Server builds the headless Server edition of the preinstalled
      image: a command prompt shell, the server product type and the SAC
      serial console on COM1.
